  "statement": {
    "coarse_arm_comparison": "on coarse_speed_v1 the gated model (mean MAE 2.329e-03) is no better than its own state-reset ablation (2.292e-03), the stateless MLP (2.343e-03) or dead reckoning (2.339e-03); the ungated control reaches 1.624e-03 and the 8-point linear fit 1.949e-03",
    "prompt_framing": "a minority of streams contain comparatively large gated losses that flip the Q4 mean",
    "recomputed_finding": "the unfavourable minority is not a scattered tail: {'aba_v1': 7, 'coarse_speed_v1': 24} of the 31 ungated-favouring streams. Every coarse_speed_v1 stream favours the ungated control (24/24), in every initialization, and that family alone contributes -1.174e-04 to an aggregate of -4.839e-05. Without it the aggregate is +8.285e-05.",
    "secondary": "2 coarse cells are extreme outliers with elevated clip rates, concentrated in one initialization"
  }
